flowchart TD
InputCaps["**Buffer Capacities**<br/>Decision variables for optimization<br/>Names list post_loading_buffer post_conveyor_buffer post_washing_buffer pre_press1_buffer pre_press2_buffer post_press12_buffer<br/>Domain discrete values {1-10}"]
NSGA2_Controller["**NSGAII Controller**<br/>Attributes pop_size n_gen n_cores RANDOM_SEED<br/>Methods initialize_population run_generation evaluate select vary environmental_selection log_results"]
Population["**Population**<br/>Attributes individuals list of Individual length POP_SIZE<br/>Methods create_initial_population"]
Individual["**Individual**<br/>Attributes capacities vector length 6 each value in {1-10}<br/>Represents one candidate design"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>Methods evaluate_individual evaluate_population run_simulation_with_caps<br/>Constraints check feasibility throughput must be positive"]
Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Attributes processes N_CORES<br/>Used to parallelize evaluation of individuals"]
Simulation["**Simulation Engine**<br/>Core method run_simulation with seed and capacities<br/>Returns objectives throughput and wip"]
DelayBuffer["**Delay Buffer**<br/>Attributes cap delay tokens in_transit store capacity<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
Machine["**Machine**<br/>Attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>State working_time failed_time blocked_time active_count is_up<br/>Methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Throughput maximize<br/>WIP minimize<br/>Objective tuple throughput and wip"]
FastSort["**Fast Non Dominated Sort**<br/>Method fast_non_dominated_sort<br/>Partitions population indices into Pareto fronts"]
CrowdDist["**Crowding Distance**<br/>Method crowding_distance<br/>Computes diversity metric inside a front"]
SelectionOps["**Selection and Variation**<br/>Methods tournament_selection one_point_crossover uniform_mutation<br/>Generates offspring population"]
ResultsWriter["**Results Writer**<br/>Writes CSV rows per evaluated individual per generation<br/>Stores generation individual capacities throughput wip"]

InputCaps --> NSGA2_Controller
NSGA2_Controller --> Population
Population --> Individual
NSGA2_Controller --> Evaluator
NSGA2_Controller --> ResultsWriter
NSGA2_Controller --> SelectionOps
NSGA2_Controller --> FastSort
NSGA2_Controller --> CrowdDist

Population --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> Pool
Pool --> Evaluator

Evaluator --> Simulation
Simulation --> Objectives

Simulation --> DelayBuffer
Simulation --> Machine

FastSort --> NSGA2_Controller
CrowdDist --> NSGA2_Controller
Objectives --> FastSort
Objectives --> CrowdDist

SelectionOps --> Population
ResultsWriter --> NSGA2_Controller

%% Details showing interaction loop
NSGA2_Controller -. Evaluates population via .-> Evaluator
Evaluator -. Runs parallel jobs via .-> Pool
Pool -. Calls simulation wrapper via .-> Simulation
Simulation -. Returns objectives via .-> Objectives
FastSort -. Ranks individuals via .-> NSGA2_Controller
CrowdDist -. Orders individuals via .-> NSGA2_Controller
NSGA2_Controller -. Applies selection and variation via .-> SelectionOps
SelectionOps -. Produces offspring which update .-> Population
NSGA2_Controller -. Logs evaluated results via .-> ResultsWriter

%% Notes for production manager clarity as separate labeled nodes
SimComponents["**Simulation Components**<br/>Key parts used by evaluator<br/>Delay buffers model queues and transit Machine models processing with failures and energy accounting"] 
SimComponents --> DelayBuffer
SimComponents --> Machine
Simulation --> SimComponents